---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/') ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;
const imageBase = `${base}assets/images/`;
---

<section class="profile-feature" aria-labelledby="profile-feature-title">
	<div class="profile-feature__portrait">
		<div class="profile-feature__sun" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<img src={`${imageBase}profile-photo.png`} alt="Dr Hao Wu" width="680" height="681" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
	</div>

	<div class="profile-feature__copy">
		<p class="profile-feature__eyebrow">A profile in practice</p>
		<h2 id="profile-feature-title">Theory, practice,<br /><em>public imagination.</em></h2>
		<blockquote>
			<p>Hao’s creative approach bridges <strong>theory and practice</strong>, supporting inclusive learning and fostering cross-cultural understanding through digital storytelling.</p>
			<p lang="zh-CN">吴豪一直致力于将理论与实践结合起来，通过媒体叙事的方法支持课堂中的包容性学习，以及跨文化理解。</p>
		</blockquote>
	</div>

	<div class="profile-feature__stats" aria-label="Profile highlights">
		<div>
			<strong>6 Years</strong>
			<span>Media Industry<br />Experience</span>
		</div>
		<div>
			<strong>3</strong>
			<span>Connected<br />Practices</span>
		</div>
		<div>
			<strong>1</strong>
			<span>Research-to-public<br />Pipeline</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.profile-feature {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
		max-width: 60rem;
		margin: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 7rem) auto 0;
		padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem) clamp(1.1rem, 5vw, 4.5rem) clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
		border-radius: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);
		background: linear-gradient(155deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.66), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22) 65%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4));
		box-shadow: 0 2rem 5rem rgba(34, 49, 68, 0.1), inset 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
		backdrop-filter: blur(30px) saturate(150%);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(30px) saturate(150%);
		text-align: center;
	}

	.profile-feature__portrait {
		position: relative;
		width: min(100%, 19rem);
		aspect-ratio: 1;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.profile-feature__sun {
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 0;
		left: 50%;
		width: 74%;
		aspect-ratio: 2 / 1;
		border-radius: 999px 999px 0 0;
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffc18b, #ff9a63);
		transform: translateX(-50%);
	}

	.profile-feature__portrait img {
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 0;
		left: 50%;
		width: 82%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: contain;
		object-position: bottom center;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
	}

	.profile-feature__copy {
		max-width: 45rem;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.profile-feature__eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
		color: #ff8f61;
		font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
		font-size: 0.68rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.profile-feature h2 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5.6vw, 5.2rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.075em;
		line-height: 0.93;
	}

	.profile-feature h2 em {
		color: #ff8f61;
		font-style: normal;
	}

	.profile-feature blockquote {
		max-width: 37rem;
		margin: 1.8rem auto 0;
		padding: 1.35rem 0;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(23, 23, 23, 0.14);
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(23, 23, 23, 0.14);
		color: #344054;
		font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.4vw, 1.12rem);
		line-height: 1.55;
	}

	.profile-feature blockquote p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.profile-feature blockquote p + p {
		margin-top: 0.9rem;
		font-size: 0.88em;
	}

	.profile-feature blockquote strong {
		color: #ff7262;
	}

	.profile-feature__stats {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 0;
		max-width: 44rem;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding-top: clamp(0.5rem, 1.5vw, 1rem);
	}

	.profile-feature__stats div {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.35rem;
		padding: 0 1rem;
		border-left: 1px solid rgba(23, 23, 23, 0.14);
	}

	.profile-feature__stats div:first-child {
		border-left: 0;
	}

	.profile-feature__stats strong {
		color: #ff8f61;
		font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 2.25rem);
		line-height: 1;
	}

	.profile-feature__stats span {
		color: #6b7178;
		font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
		font-size: 0.6rem;
		line-height: 1.35;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	@media (max-width: 560px) {
		.profile-feature__stats {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 0;
		}

		.profile-feature__stats div {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
			align-items: center;
			padding: 0.8rem 0;
			border-top: 1px solid rgba(23, 23, 23, 0.14);
			border-left: 0;
			text-align: left;
		}

		.profile-feature__stats div:first-child {
			border-top: 0;
		}
	}
</style>
